<heading>accounts delete - Remove an account.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  delete NAME
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Deletes an account. The account is soft-deleted: it is deactivated
(enabled=false) but its history remains.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
delete bob
  Delete the bob account.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
add, list, edit, groups, grants
</paragraph>
